Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:21:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] qualcommax: ipq50xx: redmi-ax3000: enable the temperature
 sensor

TSENS was disabled because the boot firmware does not turn it on and
some zones were said to report bogus critical temperatures. The upstream
driver enables the block itself on the IPQ5018 (init_tsens_v1_no_rpm),
and this IPQ5000 has a two-point calibration fused (mode 3). Read on the
board with the same enable sequence: s1-s4 (ubi32, cpu, top-glue, gephy)
at 62-63 C idle, 68 C after 4 minutes of both cores at 100 %, back to
64 C two minutes later; the zones agree within 1 C. Under a 15 min
Wi-Fi load at 1008 MHz they peaked at 77 C.

This gives the 120 C critical trips from ipq5018.dtsi and temperatures
in /sys/class/thermal and hwmon. The cpu-thermal passive trip (100 C)
has nothing to throttle with the single 1008 MHz operating point.
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts    | 13 ++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts b/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts
index 28d069cd5d..1d327b00c8 100644
--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-redmi-ax3000.dts
@@ -120,13 +120,16 @@
 };
 
 /*
- * TSENS is not enabled by the boot firmware on this IPQ5000 ("tsens
- * device is not enabled" with the vendor kernel) and some of its zones
- * report bogus critical temperatures, which shuts the board down early
- * in boot. Keep it off.
+ * The boot firmware leaves TSENS off ("tsens device is not enabled" with
+ * the vendor kernel), but the upstream driver turns it on itself on the
+ * IPQ5018 (no RPM). The IPQ5000 fuses hold a two-point calibration, and
+ * the zones read 62-63 C idle in the closed case and 68 C after 4 min
+ * of both cores at 100 %, all within 1 C of each other. This brings the
+ * critical shutdown trips (120 C) of ipq5018.dtsi and temperatures in
+ * /sys/class/thermal and hwmon.
  */
 &tsens {
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &qpic_bam {
